<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble edged down to 15,500 from 15,100 in.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble edged down to 15,500 from 15,100 in.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 15,500 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from 15,100 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    November 13	 November 12</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    15,500		15,100</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $2.438 million	  $2.114 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
